1
00:00:00,677 --> 00:00:03,617
(Arthur:)Oh, great. This again.

2
00:00:03,614 --> 00:00:07,354
(Sheldon:)Arthur, what brings you back?

3
00:00:07,351 --> 00:00:09,581
Uh, beats me. I-I just...

4
00:00:09,586 --> 00:00:12,186
hope this isn't a-a sex dream.

5
00:00:14,024 --> 00:00:15,954
(Sheldon:)In the past, you've come to me

6
00:00:15,959 --> 00:00:17,789
(Sheldon:)when I'm struggling
with a dilemma.

7
00:00:17,794 --> 00:00:20,964
And-and the one time where...
where you were afraid,

8
00:00:20,964 --> 00:00:25,264
(Arthur:)and you needed me for...
for a night light.

9
00:00:26,904 --> 00:00:28,774
What's-what's troubling you?

10
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,340
(Sheldon:)Well...

11
00:00:31,341 --> 00:00:33,311
(Sheldon:)my friends are telling me

12
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:35,740
(Sheldon:)I shouldn't abandon
my girlfriend on her birthday

13
00:00:35,746 --> 00:00:38,546
to see the new Star Wars movie.

14
00:00:38,548 --> 00:00:40,948
(Arthur:)Well, sounds right.

15
00:00:42,319 --> 00:00:44,789
(Arthur:)Can... can I get out of this...

16
00:00:44,788 --> 00:00:47,688
(Arthur:)muumuu now?

17
00:00:47,691 --> 00:00:49,761
(Sheldon:)Those are the robes of the Jedi,

18
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,690
(Sheldon:)the guardians of peace
and justice in the galaxy.

19
00:00:52,696 --> 00:01:01,026
And they... they-they don't wear
underwear.

